    "claim": "The platform mounter caches per page: control ids in CTLCACHE (5s), control records in allmetas, command stubs in alljsapis (all api.js globals). Re-mounting a control after editing its facets serves the OLD code unless those caches are cleared - agent.stage's mount() drops every settled entry (in-flight arrays of waiting callbacks stay) and resets the lib's CTLCACHE before each mount. Any other hot-remount feature needs the same.",
